WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.700
This walkthrough follows one request through
the installed

2
00:00:02.700 --> 00:00:05.600
official Pharos Skill and the local payment
skill.

3
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:07.960
Inspect a connected execution path where
tool

4
00:00:07.960 --> 00:00:10.260
results become inputs to the next decision,

5
00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:12.460
not just logs displayed side by side.

6
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.490
Use official Pharos Chain MCP to

7
00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:17.570
collect a snapshot at one block.

8
00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:20.070
Then execute cast balance for the

9
00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.590
same address at that same block.

10
00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:26.250
Compare the returned balances rather than
assuming they agree.

11
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:28.320
The final decision depends on balance

12
00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.360
agreement and the payment policy.

13
00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:32.020
If a required source is unavailable,

14
00:00:32.240 --> 00:00:34.800
or the balances disagree, deny output.

15
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:36.220
A successful tool call alone

16
00:00:36.220 --> 00:00:37.800
is not permission to proceed.

17
00:00:38.170 --> 00:00:40.790
When every required check passes, inspect

18
00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:43.070
the unsigned candidate for human review.

19
00:00:43.110 --> 00:00:45.410
This is a demonstration of the decision
flow,

20
00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.310
not a claim about a current balance.

21
00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:49.030
Nothing is signed or broadcast.
